sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as 发单人(Web)
    actor R as 接单人(Web)
    participant API as FastAPI /api/v1
    participant OS as OrderService
    participant SM as StateMachine
    participant PR as PushDispatcher
    participant RK as RecallKeyResolver
    participant GEO as Redis GEO
    participant SC as Scorer
    participant QG as QuotaGuard
    participant GL as GrabLock
    participant IG as InflightGuard
    participant WK as Celery worker
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over P,DB: ① 发单 → 召回键决策 → 定向推送
    P->>API: POST /orders {type=EXPRESS, from, to, reward, expect_minutes}
    API->>OS: create(publisher, payload)
    OS->>DB: INSERT orders(status=PENDING, deadline)
    OS->>SM: apply(CREATE) → append order_progress(seq=1)
    OS-->>API: order
    API->>GEO: GEOADD geo:orders lng lat order_id
    API->>WK: enqueue push.dispatch(order_id, round=1)
    API-->>P: 200 {order_no, deadline, hint?}

    WK->>PR: dispatch(order, round=1)
    PR->>RK: recall_keys(order)
    RK-->>PR: [(to_lat,to_lng,1000)] · BR-13 代取快递→终点
    PR->>GEO: GEOSEARCH geo:runners BYRADIUS 1000 ASC WITHDIST COUNT 500
    GEO-->>PR: [(runner_id, dist) ...] · M ≈ 40-80
    PR->>PR: pipeline HGETALL u:{uid}:flag + SCARD runner:inflight
    PR->>PR: 过滤 离线/未认证/在途≥3/受限/已推过
    PR->>SC: top_n(candidates, order, 20)
    SC-->>PR: 排序后 20 人（距离衰减+顺路度+信誉+活跃+随机）
    loop 每个 Top-20 候选人
        PR->>QG: allow(runner_id) · 3/10min, 10/1h
        alt 超频控
            PR->>DB: INSERT push_logs(channel=HALL_ONLY)
        else 允许
            PR->>DB: INSERT push_logs(channel=INBOX, score, distance_m)
            PR->>DB: INSERT notifications(kind=PUSH_NEW_ORDER)
        end
    end
    DB-->>R: 站内信红点 +（M4 订阅消息）
    R->>API: GET /push/inbox
    API-->>R: 新单卡片

    Note over P,DB: ② 抢单（三道闸）
    R->>API: POST /orders/{id}/accept  Idempotency-Key: uuid
    API->>API: TokenVerifier → require_verified
    API->>GL: acquire(order_id, uid) · 闸1 Redis Lua, O(1)
    alt 锁被占
        GL-->>API: 0
        API-->>R: 409 40901 手慢了，订单已被接走
    else 抢到锁
        GL-->>API: 1
        API->>IG: advisory_lock(runner:uid) · 按用户串行
        API->>DB: SELECT count(*) WHERE runner_id=uid AND status IN (IN_PROGRESS,DELIVERED)
        alt 在途 ≥ 3
            API->>GL: release()
            API-->>R: 409 40902 你当前有 3 单进行中
        else 未超限
            API->>DB: UPDATE orders SET status=IN_PROGRESS, runner_id=uid WHERE id=? AND status='PENDING' · 闸2 权威 CAS
            alt rowcount = 0
                API->>GL: release()
                API-->>R: 409 40901
            else rowcount = 1
                API->>SM: apply(ACCEPT) → append order_progress
                API->>GEO: ZREM geo:orders order_id
                API->>DB: INSERT notifications(kind=ACCEPTED) → 发单人
                API-->>R: 200 {status:IN_PROGRESS, accepted_at}
            end
        end
    end

    Note over P,DB: ③ 履约 → 确认 → 评价（含 24h 自动确认）
    R->>API: POST /orders/{id}/progress {action=PICKED_UP}
    API->>SM: apply(PICKED_UP) · IN_PROGRESS 自环
    SM->>DB: append order_progress(seq=n)
    SM->>DB: INSERT notifications → 发单人
    R->>API: POST /orders/{id}/deliver {images}
    API->>SM: apply(DELIVER) → status=DELIVERED, delivered_at=now(), auto_confirm_due_at=now()+24h
    API->>DB: INSERT notifications(kind=NEED_CONFIRM)

    alt 发单人 24h 内确认
        P->>API: POST /orders/{id}/confirm
        API->>SM: apply(CONFIRM) → COMPLETED, completed_at
    else 超时未确认
        WK->>DB: sweep auto_confirm: WHERE status='DELIVERED' AND auto_confirm_due_at <= now()
        Note over WK: 不读 delivered_at —— 纠纷回滚后它是旧值，会立刻误触发
        WK->>SM: apply(AUTO_CONFIRM) → COMPLETED, auto_confirmed=true
    end
    SM->>DB: INSERT credit_logs(delta=+1) → runner, score_after
    SM->>DB: INSERT notifications(AUTO_CONFIRMED / CONFIRMED)

    P->>API: POST /orders/{id}/review {rating=5, tags, content}
    API->>DB: INSERT reviews(direction=P2R) · UNIQUE(order_id, from_id)
    API->>DB: INSERT credit_logs(delta=+0.5) → runner
    R->>API: POST /orders/{id}/review {rating=5}
    API->>DB: INSERT reviews(direction=R2P)
    API-->>P: 200 双方信誉分已更新（影响下一轮召回权重）

    Note over P,DB: ④ 接单人静默 → BR-35 预警（40min）→ 双出口（T16 投诉 / T17 自助取消，45min）
    WK->>DB: sweep: WHERE status='IN_PROGRESS' AND accepted_at < now()-40min LIMIT 500
    SM->>DB: probe_progress(order) → (has_progress, since) · actor_id=runner_id AND action IN RUNNER_EVIDENCE
    alt 静默 ≥40min 且本单未预警过
        WK->>DB: SET warn:{order_id} NX EX 7200（Redis 去重，每单 1 次）
        WK->>R: 站内信 RUNNER_SILENT_WARN「5 分钟后发单人可申请介入」
    end

    P->>API: POST /orders/{id}/cancel {mode:lost}  或  POST /orders/{id}/dispute
    API->>SM: apply(CANCEL_LOST) 或 apply(DISPUTE_OPENED)
    SM->>DB: probe_progress(order) → has_progress / since（发单人的催单/取消申请不计入）
    alt has_progress = false 且 距抢单 ≥45min → T17 自助取消
        SM->>DB: UPDATE orders SET status=CANCELLED WHERE id=? AND status='IN_PROGRESS'
        SM->>DB: credit_logs(-3) + progress(CANCEL_LOST) + release_inflight(uid)
        API-->>P: 200 {status: CANCELLED}
    else has_progress = true 且 静默 ≥45min → T16 失联投诉（免举证）
        SM->>DB: UPDATE orders SET status=DISPUTED, pre_dispute_status='IN_PROGRESS', settle_state=FROZEN
        SM->>DB: progress(DISPUTE_OPENED) + disputes(reason=RUNNER_LOST)
        API-->>P: 200 {status: DISPUTED}
    else 不满足（未满 45min / 出口与进度状态不匹配 / 非发单人）
        API-->>P: 422 42201（或 403 40310）
    end
    Note over API,DB: T16 与 T17 互斥在守卫层：同一时刻只有一支能通过，并发与重放同样进不来

    Note over P,DB: ⑤ 仲裁回流（BR-34 挂起态：DISPUTED 不是终态）
    API->>SM: apply(ARBITRATE_FREE) · 支持接单人
    SM->>DB: UPDATE orders SET status=pre_dispute_status, pre_dispute_status=NULL, settle_state=UNSETTLED
    SM->>DB: 若回 DELIVERED：auto_confirm_due_at=now()+24h（重写，重新起算；delivered_at 不动）
    Note right of DB: pre=IN_PROGRESS → T13；pre=DELIVERED/COMPLETED → T14 原样回滚（不擅自置 COMPLETED）
    API->>SM: apply(ARBITRATE_LIABLE) · 支持发单人 / 部分担责
    SM->>DB: UPDATE orders SET status=CANCELLED, pre_dispute_status=NULL + credit_penalty
